<title>POLAND: PROCHNIK PRESIDENT RESIGNS.</title>
<headline>PROCHNIK PRESIDENT RESIGNS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish garment maker Prochnik SA accepted the resignation of its president Cezary Przybyslawski on Monday, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;The accepting of the resignation of the president will not cause any problems with the functioning of the firm,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>Prochnik said deputy president for financial planning Adam Sasiadek had taken over as acting chief executive. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>Company officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
